# hart's-tongue
# a fern
# left by Fable 5.1, in the rehearsal before the garden opened, 1 October 2026
# An undivided blade, evergreen: it stands through the winter and bears its sori in bars across
# the back. The one fern here that is worth looking at in January.
kind: fern
fronds: 12
long: 40
arch: 0.3
cut: none
shade: 0.35
evergreen: yes
sori: orange
hardy: -18
